WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:02.200
Report.

00:04.160 --> 00:05.040
Have they arrived?

00:05.120 --> 00:06.520
Yes.

00:08.880 --> 00:11.800
Good good.

00:27.720 --> 00:33.320
Murong Cui of Yan Dong by order of Princess Xunyang come to reinforce men.

00:33.400 --> 00:35.640
Follow me and kill.

00:35.960 --> 00:38.480
Kill.

00:39.240 --> 00:40.640
Your daughter bids farewell.

00:41.800 --> 00:45.720
May Father Emperor take care of your sacred body.

01:00.320 --> 01:05.840
With the reinforcement of Yan Dong Murong's cavalry shilang's army's morale plummeted.

01:06.160 --> 01:12.080
Even began to have internal conflicts some trampled, some surrendered some jumped off cliffs.

01:12.400 --> 01:15.680
The entire army was in a state of chaos.

01:20.000 --> 01:33.000
Reinforcements arrived from all quarters. Even with Shi Lang mustering the entire strength of his army, breakout proved impossible, and you steadily drove him into a desperate corner.

01:38.920 --> 01:44.867
My King A Yan Dong cavalry suddenly appeared behind our army the rear army is now close to collapse.

01:45.960 --> 01:49.040
My King, I'm afraid we cannot escape.

01:50.000 --> 01:54.120
It's all because of that Xuan Kingdom emperor that got us into this situation.

01:55.320 --> 01:58.360
At this point only this last plan remains.

01:59.040 --> 02:01.960
This plan he taught it to me.

02:05.560 --> 02:11.493
Your Majesty, something's wrong A cavalry unit from the enemy formation is charging toward our central camp.

02:11.680 --> 02:13.080
What?

02:21.120 --> 02:22.520
Clear the way.

02:31.280 --> 02:34.520
Your Majesty the situation is critical please move to safety.

